    <bpmn:task id="Bridge_2_c555" name="Here is the transition sentence connecting Process A and Process B:&#10;&#10;Upon completion of the reimbursement payment to the customer in Process A, the **Payment Office** initiates Process B by generating the weekly vendor payment report. This report acts as the trigger for the subsequent **vendor payment**, **client invoicing**, and **invoice archiving** steps involving the Registry Office and Accounts Receivable Department." />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_2" sourceRef="atom_1_sid-A92F1CA8-27BA-41F6-8232-D46524F9AAC9" targetRef="Bridge_2_c555" />
